==============================================================================
Third-party code
==============================================================================

Parts of this product are ported to Python from rvt-rs
(https://github.com/DrunkOnJava/rvt-rs), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0:

    rvt-rs — open reader for Autodesk Revit files
    Copyright 2026 Griffin Long

The ported parts are the container reader and stream decompression
(rvt_prt/core/container.py), the class registry
(rvt_prt/core/registry.py), the partition segment framing and object-graph
decoder (rvt_prt/core/objgraph.py), and the saved-graphics surface and
edge-loop evaluation (rvt_prt/elements/savedgraphics.py). They were
modified in the porting.

rvt-rs itself is compiled into this product's native extension
(rvt_prt._native, from the rvt crate on crates.io), so binary
distributions of this product contain rvt-rs object code. rvt-rs's own
NOTICE, reproduced in native/NOTICE-rvt-rs (from the pinned release),
applies to that code. The Rust crates linked into the extension are
listed with their licenses in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES where a binary distribution includes one.

